#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; is a simple graphical front-end to Simond. It creates and "
"displays a tray-icon from which you can start and stop the Simond server. "
"Moreover it provides a configuration dialog in which it embeds the Simond "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; je jednostavan grafički prikazni program prema Simondu. Kreira i "
"prikazuje ikonu poslužitelja, pomoću koje možete pokrenuti i zaustaviti "
"Simod server. Osim toga pruža dijalog konfiguracije u kojoj se ugrađuje "
"Simond konfiguracije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond can be configured to be started on KDE start."
msgstr "KSimond može biti konfigurisan da se pokreće na pokretanju KDE."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please report any problems or feature requests to <ulink url=\"http://"
"sourceforge.net/tracker/?group_id=190872\">our bug tracker</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas prijavite probleme ili karakteristike upite na <ulink url="
"\"http://sourceforge.net/tracker/?group_id=190872\">naš pratioc buba</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kappname;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kappname;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Due to its minimalistic nature KSimond itself does not even have an "
"application window. However, the tray icon has a context menu from where you "
"can start and stop Simond and also open the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Zbog svoje minimalističke prirode KSimond nema niti jedan prozor aplikacije. "
"Međutim, ikona u donjem uglu ima kontekst izbornik odakle možete pokrenuti i "
"zaustaviti Simond i također otvoriti konfiguraciju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "screenshot of &kappname;"
msgstr "slika zaslona &kappname;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond \"screenshot\""
msgstr "KSimond \"slika zaslona\""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"KSimond has the ability to launch automatically when KDE starts and to "
"handle unexpected Simond crashes."
msgstr ""
"KSimond ima mogućnosti da se automatski pokrene kada se KDE pokrene i i za "
"rukovanje neočekivanih Simon padova."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "screenshot of the &kappname;-configuration"
msgstr "slika zaslona od &kappname;-konfiguracija"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond configuration"
msgstr "Ksimond konfiguracija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that the option to start KSimond at login will work on both "
"Microsoft Windows and when you are using KDE on Linux. Support for other "
"desktop environments like Gnome, XFCE, etc. might require manually placing "
"KSimond in the session autostart (please refer to the respective manuals of "
"your desktop environment)."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da je opcija za početak KSimond na prijavljivanje će raditi i "
"na Microsoft Windowsu i kada se koristi KDE na Linuxu. Podrška za druge "
"desktop okruženja kao što su Gnome, XFCE, itd može zahtijevati ručno "
"postavljanje KSimonda na automatsko pokretanje (pogledajte odgovarajuća "
"uputstvu za vaše desktop okruženje)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alongside the KSimond configuration the Simond configuration modules are "
"listed (also available through systemsettings). See the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"simond\">Simond manual</ulink> for details."
msgstr ""
"Pored KSimond konfiguracije, Simond konfiguracije modula su navedene "
"(također dostupan kroz postavke sistema). Pogledajte <ulink url=\"help:/"
"simond\">Simond ručno</ulink> za detalje."

